            "description": "Returns GPS data for the last 7 days including latest GPS coordinates per terminal and heatmap data.\n\n**Features:**\n- Latest GPS coordinates\n- Heatmap visualization data\n- Time distribution (based on duration)\n- Coverage area\n- Distance traveled"
